{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35423","headline":"刘阮再到天台不复见仙子 · 曹唐","name":"刘阮再到天台不复见仙子","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"再到天台访玉真，青苔白石已成尘。\n笙歌冥寞闲深洞，云鹤萧条绝旧隣。\n草树总非前度色，烟霞不似昔年春。\n桃花流水依然在，不见当时劝酒人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曹唐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35423.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35423","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}